#: templates/tolmach/landing.html:6
msgid "What is «Tolmach»?"
msgstr "Tolmach是什么？"

#: templates/tolmach/landing.html:7
msgid ""
"«Tolmach» is an integrated translating environment, service that combines all "
"necessary tools for the translator in one place — glossaries, translation "
"memory databases, dictionaries, machine translation engines and more. All "
"the paperwork also will be done by «Tolmach». All you have to do is to load "
"the document into the system. All the extraction of useful text and division "
"up into easy to translate fragments will be produced automatically."
msgstr ""
"“Tolmach”是一种将词汇表、翻译内存数据库、词典、机器翻译引擎等所有必要的翻译工"
"具相结合的翻译集成环境和服务。全部书面工作也是被«Tolmach»做的你只要把文案上传"
"到Tolmach系统而已。这个软件自动地提取有用的文本也会把文本分裂成容易翻译的片"
"段。"

#: templates/tolmach/landing.html:8
msgid "A problem shared is a problem halved"
msgstr "共享的问题就是减半的问题"

